  "is.other_lines values as printed in the expense direction (positive = expense).",
  "ngaap.items_total_pre = operating-level \"Non-GAAP adjustments\" line (Exhibit 5 Total SPGI OP); interest-line adjustment (premium amortization benefit, footnote h) printed separately as 6 (adjusted interest 95 vs GAAP 88). items_total_net/ps are the NI/EPS reconciliation \"Non-GAAP adjustments\" line.",
  "Footnote (g) CORP pre-tax items sum to 181 vs printed corp_nongaap 180 (company rounding). Item after-tax sum (276) + amortization 209 + 511 = 996 vs printed adjusted NI 996.",
  "Mobility: 68 + 4 + 76 = 148 vs printed adjusted OP 149 (company rounding).",
  "Non-GAAP adjusted tax line: non-GAAP adjustments (37), deal-related amortization 66.",
  "cfpub: capex and nci_dist recorded as positive outflows. Three-month FCF from Exhibit 8 in fcf_pub_q / adj_fcf_pub_q.",
  "No organic/constant-currency table; Exhibit 5 gives adjusted revenue (excl. 2022 divestitures): total 3,101 vs prior-year adjusted 2,970."
 ],
